  "solution": {
    "text": "First arrange&nbsp;<math><mn>15</mn></math> boys in <math><mn>15</mn><mo>!</mo></math>&nbsp;ways.<br /><math><mn>16</mn></math> gaps will be created.&nbsp;<br />Select any <math><mn>3</mn></math> gaps out of <math><mn>16</mn></math> gaps in <math><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> ways.<br />Arrange <math><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> boys to be separated in these selected <math><mn>3</mn></math> gaps in <math><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></math> ways.<br />Number of ways <math><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>"
